(text "GPIO8/GPIO9 are strapping pins: GPIO9 low at reset (SW1 held) = download mode.\nVBAT (pad 15) is tied to 3V3 inside the module (R2 = 0R); connected here as well.\nUnused GPIO0/1/2/3/4/25: no connect, firmware disables input + pull-down.\nJ1 is a pad row (not fitted) without a supply pin: the cell (or a bench supply on its contacts) powers the board.\nReset for programming: SW2 (RST) or the USB-Serial/JTAG reset; EN is on test pad TP6, not on J1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214.63 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "945e1153-4d21-5bf3-8e1a-5465c41dbcc5"))
