(text "CR2450 ONLY - NOT RECHARGEABLE. No other supply can reach the rail: the cell is the only energy source.\nPower-path decision and its limits: docs/decisions.md, docs/power_budget.md (ESTIMATE until measured).\nCurrent measurement: remove R1 (cell) or R21 (load) and insert the ammeter.\nU3 TPS3839K33: 2.93 V typ (2.857-2.974 V), push-pull ~RESET, 200 ms delay; R22 keeps it from fighting SW2 / TP6 (EN)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2894fefb-4968-5a01-9732-c11b015127a9"))
